@host = http://localhost:8098
@sourceId = replace-with-id-from-create-response

### 1) Store a trusted text source; this does not index it
POST {{host}}/api/documents/sources
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=demo

--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Incident response runbook
--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tenantId"

tenant-acme
--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="visibility"

internal
--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="incident-runbook.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Rotate impacted credentials within four hours, notify the customer success owner, and preserve audit evidence.
--demo--

### 2) Preview bounded chunks; no queue/vector work occurs
GET {{host}}/api/documents/sources/{{sourceId}}/preview

### 3) Confirm no evidence is active before submission
GET {{host}}/api/documents/query?query=Rotate%20impacted%20credentials&tenantId=tenant-acme&limit=5

### 4) Submit indexing and capture the returned work IDs
POST {{host}}/api/documents/sources/{{sourceId}}/index

### 5) Poll until source.status=INDEXED and activeVersion=1
GET {{host}}/api/documents/sources/{{sourceId}}

### 6) Retrieve active evidence with source/version/chunk attribution
GET {{host}}/api/documents/query?query=Rotate%20impacted%20credentials%20within%20four%20hours&tenantId=tenant-acme&limit=5

### 7) Cross-tenant query must return no evidence
GET {{host}}/api/documents/query?query=Rotate%20impacted%20credentials&tenantId=tenant-other&limit=5

### 8) Store version 2 while version 1 remains active
PUT {{host}}/api/documents/sources/{{sourceId}}/content
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=demo

--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Incident response runbook v2
--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tenantId"

tenant-acme
--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="visibility"

internal
--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="incident-runbook.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Rotate impacted credentials within two hours, notify security and customer success, preserve audit evidence, and open a review task.
--demo--

### 9) Submit the candidate; old evidence is not deleted first
POST {{host}}/api/documents/sources/{{sourceId}}/index

### 10) Poll until version 2 is ACTIVE and version 1 is DELETED
GET {{host}}/api/documents/sources/{{sourceId}}

### 11) Verify retrieval identifies only active version 2
GET {{host}}/api/documents/query?query=Rotate%20impacted%20credentials%20within%20two%20hours&tenantId=tenant-acme&limit=5

### 12) Queue exact deletion of the active manifest
DELETE {{host}}/api/documents/sources/{{sourceId}}

### 13) Poll until source.status=DELETED
GET {{host}}/api/documents/sources/{{sourceId}}

### 14) Deleted evidence must no longer be retrievable
GET {{host}}/api/documents/query?query=Rotate%20impacted%20credentials&tenantId=tenant-acme&limit=5

### 15) Safety path: unsupported extension fails closed
POST {{host}}/api/documents/sources
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=demo

--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tenantId"

tenant-acme
--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="unsafe.exe"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

not a trusted document
--demo--
